{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Touchdown Poker</i> is fast-paced digital card game that blends the core elements of Poker with the energy and iconic rules of American Football.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The premise is simple - play Poker hands to win yards on the football field, score Touchdowns and beat all before you. Win Games and Tournaments to earn Rewards and increase the size of your Locker Room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack the deck with Special Plays and unleash Star Players who bend the rules and trigger game-changing boosts for the Offense and Defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love sport? Know your way round a deck of cards? Strap on your helmet and hit the field - <i>Touchdown Poker</i> is about to kick-off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Note</strong></u>: Screenshots are of our prototype, and do not depict final game art.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3656270?t=1756303224","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656270/18059456f5e8f985164813648b9fbabd40b13b26/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756303224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656270/22b94d9623c12b620a768b59f67af9d56e1954e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756303224","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656270/22b94d9623c12b620a768b59f67af9d56e1954e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756303224","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Touchdown Poker</i> is fast-paced digital card game that blends the core elements of Poker with the energy and iconic rules of American Football.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The premise is simple - p